{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41867","headline":"思九江旧居三首 一 · 李中","name":"思九江旧居三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结茅曾在碧江隈，多病贫身养拙来。\n雨歇汀洲垂钓去，月当门巷访僧回。\n静临窗下开琴匣，闷向牀头泼酒醅。\n游宦等闲千里隔，空余魂梦到渔台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41867.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41867","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}